      "message": "fix(ui): the incoming stock draws even when the traced stock replaces the stock pass\n\nHand check of #519 on a real GPU (Apple Metal): the incoming stock was\nmeasured exactly but never drawn. With toolpaths in the document the\ntraced whole-program stock view draws in place of the stock index\nrange - and the teal incoming part lived in that range. The upload now\nsorts overlay stock parts (the incoming stock, class 4) last in the\nstock range and render() draws [overlay_index_start, stock_index_end)\nafter the traced stock as well.\n\nPinned by incoming_view_tests::the_incoming_part_sorts_after_the_stock_\nthe_traced_view_replaces (draw_order: models, stock, overlay, fills;\na judged rest/gouge class is never taken for the overlay).\n\nRefs #406\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
