      "message": "docs: #406's decision record follows the closed block and the overlay order\n\nThe record still named the closed shell as dropped and the traced stock\nview as hiding the preview; the GUI-check fixes reversed both (a closed\nblock via setup_stock_shell, drawn after the traced stock via\nviewport::draw_order). Records the hand check of 2026-11-10. No code.\n\nRefs #406\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
